{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to be a gambling cut-throat rogue, a righteous monk, or a spellcrafting mage? Dungeon Gang is a multiplayer RPG where you can do this and more with up to 12 players. Includes a custom dungeon creator.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character and put together a Dungeon Gang with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different character classes - play as a Warrior, Rogue, Monk, Soldier, Ranger, Sorcerer, or Mage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the land of Zabasba and face the foes within its dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast a wide range of spells and design your own spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read in-game books to increase your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with several types of weapons or just use your fists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haggle with merchants &amp; flip coins for gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puff on pipes and relax with Halflings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom dungeons with deadly traps, interactive objects, and a wide range of monsters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337640?t=1769797211","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337640?t=1769797211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337640/7b2345895be4cf0c31fcad0bf0cb0808118c4631/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769797211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337640/7b2345895be4cf0c31fcad0bf0cb0808118c4631/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769797211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level e